.git
.github
output
artifacts
*.iso
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.tar.xz
*.zip
vendor
*.icm
*.hft

# vendor-data/ is the one deliberate exception: licensed 245igdi files supplied
# by a local builder. It is git-ignored, so public CI has no such directory and
# these rules never let proprietary files into a published image.
!vendor-data
!vendor-data/**

# fonts/ is the other deliberate exception: proprietary Microsoft/Office fonts
# supplied by a local builder. It is git-ignored, so public CI has no such
# directory and never bakes them into a published image.
